  "title": "sctp tap: Fix copying checksum string",
  "description": "In [g_]strlcpy, the dest_size parameter is the buffer size, not the\nnumber of bytes to copy. Fix truncating the last byte of the string\nof the checksum type when copying. This affects display in the\nSCTP association dialogs, etc.\n\n\n(cherry picked from commit ae3b2033e45be3cb4e703e48be85ba387f91b3a5)",
